Z||000000||Neverfinished||01-31-2001||05:28 PM||||I've been contemplating painting my wipers white to go with the purple white theme on my car but can't figure out how to remove the wipers? has anyone done this? Is it very hard to remove the wiper arms.<BR>thx||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||01-31-2001||06:06 PM||||I believe the wiper arms are just pressed on over a "grooved" shaft.  They should just pull off. May need some assistance and need to be pried off.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phil||01-31-2001||06:14 PM||||Old Lar is correct but there is a little trick to aid the removal. There is a little hole right near the hinge pin on the arm, lift the arm and put a small nail or wire into the hole. Once the arm stays back on its own just pull it off.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Neverfinished||01-31-2001||06:31 PM||||Thanks guys, just went outside and got them off. Everyones help on this forum is great.<BR>||||reg||1
